{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"history.fcgov.com/Fort Collins Detailed Time Line 1960.txt"},"lines":{"text":"CSU's new 30,000 seat Hughes Stadium will be dedicated at 1 p.m. Saturday prior to the CSU-Air Force Academy game. The 30 minute dedication ceremony included the Air Force Band (welcomed by president Morgan) and a dedicatory address by Gov. Love. Dr. Morgan then presented the stadium to the Board of Agriculture. Bill Cosby did a show at 8:00 P.M. Saturday in the Colorado State University Auditorium, presented by CSU's Special Events Board, in connection with the dedication.\n"},"line_number":503,"absolute_offset":29639,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"Air Force Academy"},"start":91,"end":108}]}}
